        "id": "yidhari-basic_attack-frostbite_embrace",
        "name": "Frostbite Embrace (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "Hold [BASIC] to activate:\n\nYidhari begins charging, continuously consuming HP to reach up to three levels of charge. When /bBasic Attack//b is released, Yidhari unleashes a powerful charged hammer attack in front based on the current charge level, dealing massive Ice DMG. The higher Yidhari's HP, the faster charging consumes it. HP consumption will at most reduce Yidhari's HP to 25% of Max HP.\n\nAt 2 charge levels, after using the skill, press [BASIC] to immediately follow up with the 3rd hit of /bBasic Attack: Crushing Strike//b. The DMG of a /bBasic Attack: Crushing Strike//b triggered this way increases based on the current charge level, up to 30%. At 3 charge levels, Yidhari gains increased Anti-Interrupt level during the charged skill. Press [BASIC] to chain early into the finishing smash.",
