        "name": "Frost's Crushing Weight (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "While charging or spinning during /bBasic Attack: Frostbite Embrace//b, if hit by an enemy, Yidhari can block with her tentacles, reducing the DMG taken by 25%.\n\nIf charging or not yet at full charge, Yidhari counterattacks with her tentacles, returning to the charging stance and instantly gaining 1 charge level, while also dealing Ice DMG to enemies ahead.\n\nWhile /bFrost's Crushing Weight//b is active, pressing /bBasic Attack//b makes Yidhari immediately unleash the finishing slam of /bBasic Attack: Frostbite Embrace//b based on her current charge level.\n\nWhile Frost's Crushing Weight is active, pressing [SPECIAL] or [EX] makes Yidhari unleash a /bSpecial Attack: Surging Cold//b, /bCrushing Pursuit//b that is guaranteed to trigger /bSurging Cold//b.",
